IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pa-development`

-- Planning Act 1998, ss 2 to 4, 12, 12A, 20 and the Fourth Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_pa.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a paid two-week stay in a condo flat` MEANS Stay WITH
    `in a building originally constructed as a dwelling house` IS TRUE
    `months the same person occupies` IS 0.5
    `rent or other consideration is paid` IS TRUE

`a paid six-month lease of a condo flat` MEANS Stay WITH
    `in a building originally constructed as a dwelling house` IS TRUE
    `months the same person occupies` IS 6
    `rent or other consideration is paid` IS TRUE

`a free two-week stay with a friend` MEANS Stay WITH
    `in a building originally constructed as a dwelling house` IS TRUE
    `months the same person occupies` IS 0.5
    `rent or other consideration is paid` IS FALSE

`a paid exactly-three-month stay` MEANS Stay WITH
    `in a building originally constructed as a dwelling house` IS TRUE
    `months the same person occupies` IS 3
    `rent or other consideration is paid` IS TRUE

`a paid week in a hotel` MEANS Stay WITH
    `in a building originally constructed as a dwelling house` IS FALSE
    `months the same person occupies` IS 0.25
    `rent or other consideration is paid` IS TRUE

`seven paying unrelated workers` MEANS Household WITH
