`six paying unrelated workers` MEANS Household WITH
    `paying occupants` IS 6
    `all occupants are one family, a domestic worker registered there, or a carer` IS FALSE

`an extended family of eight paying the parents` MEANS Household WITH
    `paying occupants` IS 8
    `all occupants are one family, a domestic worker registered there, or a carer` IS TRUE

