    `the breach involves dormitory accommodation` IS FALSE
    `the breach includes demolition in a conservation area` IS FALSE
    `is a repeat offender` IS TRUE

`a first-time dormitory operator` MEANS Breach WITH
    `the breach involves dormitory accommodation` IS TRUE
    `the breach includes demolition in a conservation area` IS FALSE
    `is a repeat offender` IS FALSE

`a shophouse demolished in a conservation area` MEANS Breach WITH
    `the breach involves dormitory accommodation` IS FALSE
    `the breach includes demolition in a conservation area` IS TRUE
    `is a repeat offender` IS FALSE

`an owner whose tenant runs short-term lets` MEANS OwnerCase WITH
    `the tenant or contractor carried out unauthorised development` IS TRUE
    `the owner took all reasonable precautions` IS FALSE
    `due diligence could not have prevented it` IS FALSE
    `it happened before the defendant owned the land and was another's act` IS FALSE

`an owner who prohibited and inspected` MEANS OwnerCase WITH
    `the tenant or contractor carried out unauthorised development` IS TRUE
    `the owner took all reasonable precautions` IS TRUE
    `due diligence could not have prevented it` IS FALSE
    `it happened before the defendant owned the land and was another's act` IS FALSE

`an owner who could not have known` MEANS OwnerCase WITH
    `the tenant or contractor carried out unauthorised development` IS TRUE
    `the owner took all reasonable precautions` IS FALSE
    `due diligence could not have prevented it` IS TRUE
    `it happened before the defendant owned the land and was another's act` IS FALSE

`a buyer of a flat already let short-term` MEANS OwnerCase WITH
