    `the owner took all reasonable precautions` IS FALSE
    `due diligence could not have prevented it` IS FALSE
    `it happened before the defendant owned the land and was another's act` IS TRUE

`an owner whose tenant did nothing wrong` MEANS OwnerCase WITH
    `the tenant or contractor carried out unauthorised development` IS FALSE
    `the owner took all reasonable precautions` IS FALSE
    `due diligence could not have prevented it` IS FALSE
    `it happened before the defendant owned the land and was another's act` IS FALSE

