§ `s 3 -- development`

#ASSERT `the activity is development` `building an extension`
#ASSERT `the activity is development` `demolishing a building`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is development` `internal renovation not affecting appearance or floor area`
#ASSERT `the activity is development` `using a house as two separate houses`
#ASSERT `the activity is development` `using a house as an office`
#ASSERT `the activity is development` `using a warehouse as a dwelling`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is development` `a garden shed for household use`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is development` `changing within the same use class`
#ASSERT `the activity is development` `an advertisement on a wall not normally used for one`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is development` `letting a home to the same tenant for 3 months or more`
#ASSERT `the activity is development` `letting a home for paid stays of under 3 months`
#ASSERT `the activity is development` `letting a home as dormitory accommodation`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is development` `a family living in its own home`

#ASSERT `the stay is short-term accommodation under the Fourth Schedule` `a paid two-week stay in a condo flat`
#ASSERT NOT `the stay is short-term accommodation under the Fourth Schedule` `a paid six-month lease of a condo flat`
#ASSERT NOT `the stay is short-term accommodation under the Fourth Schedule` `a free two-week stay with a friend`
#ASSERT NOT `the stay is short-term accommodation under the Fourth Schedule` `a paid exactly-three-month stay`
#ASSERT NOT `the stay is short-term accommodation under the Fourth Schedule` `a paid week in a hotel`

#ASSERT `the accommodation is dormitory accommodation` `seven paying unrelated workers`
#ASSERT NOT `the accommodation is dormitory accommodation` `six paying unrelated workers`
#ASSERT NOT `the accommodation is dormitory accommodation` `an extended family of eight paying the parents`

#ASSERT NOT `use before 2017 escapes the Fourth Schedule` 2015

